{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976176434,"sessionID":"ses_1ccc1fee4ffeV8vBX5DU4UlgmR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_fuvW6Pywjq3dAYKGHKNwOhTK","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"## Bug\\n\\nIn `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml`, line 46:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An acquired metabolic disease that is has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nShould be:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An inherited metabolic disease that has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nTwo issues:\\n1. **\\\"acquired\\\" should be \\\"inherited\\\"** — this is a pattern for inborn errors of metabolism, not acquired diseases. Appears to be a copy-paste from `acquired.yaml`.\\n2. **\\\"is has\\\" should be \\\"has\\\"** — minor grammar typo.\\n\\nThe `equivalentTo` clause correctly references `inborn errors of metabolism` (MONDO:0019052), so the logical definition is fine — only the text template is wrong.\\n\\nFound during analysis of the \\\"inborn\\\" classification axis in [#9986](https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9986).\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"Copy-paste error in inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml: definition says 'acquired' instead of 'inherited'\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9987\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"## Bug\\n\\nIn `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml`, line 46:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An acquired metabolic disease that is has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nShould be:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An inherited metabolic disease that has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nTwo issues:\\n1. **\\\"acquired\\\" should be \\\"inherited\\\"** — this is a pattern for inborn errors of metabolism, not acquired diseases. Appears to be a copy-paste from `acquired.yaml`.\\n2. **\\\"is has\\\" should be \\\"has\\\"** — minor grammar typo.\\n\\nThe `equivalentTo` clause correctly references `inborn errors of metabolism` (MONDO:0019052), so the logical definition is fine — only the text template is wrong.\\n\\nFound during analysis of the \\\"inborn\\\" classification axis in [#9986](https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9986).\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Copy-paste error in inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml: definition says 'acquired' instead of 'inherited'\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9987\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778976176379,"end":1778976176430}},"id":"prt_e333e38f3001SQlfqc10esMne2","sessionID":"ses_1ccc1fee4ffeV8vBX5DU4UlgmR","messageID":"msg_e333e2900001CYR79GTrQ9Qtxo"}}
